{"id":"24a3d0c12f4602b7","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-formula.md","title":"内建的多排序一阶公式语法","display":"df-formula — 内建的多排序一阶公式语法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-formula","aliases":["16-df-formula","Formula"],"display":"df-formula — 内建的多排序一阶公式语法","depends_on":[],"source":"§4.1 pp. 221–224 (PDF 241–244); finite tagged-tree presentation expanded locally","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-formula</span><span>Formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — 内建的多排序一阶公式语法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"§4.1 pp. 221–224 (PDF 241–244); finite tagged-tree presentation expanded locally"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle S,F,P,a_F,a_P\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle S,F,P,a_F,a_P\\rangle\\)</span> 为小签名数据，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F:F\\to S^*\\times S\">\\(a_F:F\\to S^*\\times S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_P:P\\to S^*\">\\(a_P:P\\to S^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^*=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n\">\\(S^*=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n\\)</span>。变量池 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_s=\\{\\langle s,i\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(V_s=\\{\\langle s,i\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，各池互不相交。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf v,\\mathsf f,\\mathsf e,\\mathsf p,\\mathsf t,\\mathsf b,\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i,\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\">\\(\\mathsf v,\\mathsf f,\\mathsf e,\\mathsf p,\\mathsf t,\\mathsf b,\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i,\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\\)</span> 为两两不交、单射的有限树构造标签，分别编码变量、函数应用、等式、谓词应用、真、假、合取、析取、蕴涵、全称与存在。标签不是语义联结词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是无重复变量的有限列表；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{set}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{set}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为其元素集。下文在阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 上递归构造项与公式，随后对有限树递归定义自由变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时允许空参数列表。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_1,\\operatorname{pr}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_1,\\operatorname{pr}_2\\)</span> 为有序对投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}\">\\(a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}\">\\(a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}\\)</span> 在下文定义。每个参数列表的长度均由其实际元数给出，递归式不使用未绑定的排序列表或长度。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma,A_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Sen}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma,A_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Sen}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fml}_{16}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Fml}_{16}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 为本页构造的集合或集合值记号。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_1(a_F(f)),\\qquad\na_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_2(a_F(f))\\quad(f\\in F),\\\\\nT_s^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf v(x)\\mid x\\in V_s\\},\\\\\nT_s^{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq T_s^k\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf f(f,\\vec t)\\mid f\\in F\\land a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)=s\n\\land\\vec t\\in\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)|}T_{a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)_j}^k\\},\\\\\nT_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}T_s^k,\\\\\nA_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf e(s,t,u)\\mid s\\in S\\land t,u\\in T_s\\}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf p(p,\\vec t)\\mid p\\in P\n\\land\\vec t\\in\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_P(p)|}T_{a_P(p)_j}\\},\\\\\nL^0&amp;\\coloneqq A_\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\mathsf t,\\mathsf b\\},\\\\\nL^{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq L^k\\cup\\{c(\\varphi,\\psi)\\mid\nc\\in\\{\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i\\}\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in L^k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{q(x,\\varphi)\\mid q\\in\\{\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\\}\\land\nx\\in\\bigcup_{s\\in S}V_s\\land\\varphi\\in L^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}L^k.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_1(a_F(f)),\\qquad\na_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_2(a_F(f))\\quad(f\\in F),\\\\\nT_s^0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf v(x)\\mid x\\in V_s\\},\\\\\nT_s^{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq T_s^k\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf f(f,\\vec t)\\mid f\\in F\\land a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)=s\n\\land\\vec t\\in\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)|}T_{a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)_j}^k\\},\\\\\nT_s&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}T_s^k,\\\\\nA_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf e(s,t,u)\\mid s\\in S\\land t,u\\in T_s\\}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf p(p,\\vec t)\\mid p\\in P\n\\land\\vec t\\in\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_P(p)|}T_{a_P(p)_j}\\},\\\\\nL^0&amp;\\coloneqq A_\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\mathsf t,\\mathsf b\\},\\\\\nL^{k+1}&amp;\\coloneqq L^k\\cup\\{c(\\varphi,\\psi)\\mid\nc\\in\\{\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i\\}\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in L^k\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{q(x,\\varphi)\\mid q\\in\\{\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\\}\\land\nx\\in\\bigcup_{s\\in S}V_s\\land\\varphi\\in L^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}L^k.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf v(x))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf f(f,\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{FV}(t_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf e(s,t,u))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf p(p,\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{FV}(t_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(c(\\varphi,\\psi))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\n&amp;&amp;c\\in\\{\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(q(x,\\varphi))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n&amp;&amp;q\\in\\{\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in(\\bigcup_{s\\in S}V_s)^*\\mid\n(\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\Gamma|\\})(i&lt;j\\Longrightarrow\\Gamma_i\\ne\\Gamma_j)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma\\mid\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{set}(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(()),&amp;\n\\mathsf{Fml}_{16}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf i(\\varphi,\\mathsf b).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf v(x))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf f(f,\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{FV}(t_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf e(s,t,u))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf p(p,\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{FV}(t_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf b)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(c(\\varphi,\\psi))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\n&amp;&amp;c\\in\\{\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(q(x,\\varphi))&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n&amp;&amp;q\\in\\{\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in(\\bigcup_{s\\in S}V_s)^*\\mid\n(\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\Gamma|\\})(i&lt;j\\Longrightarrow\\Gamma_i\\ne\\Gamma_j)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma\\mid\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{set}(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(()),&amp;\n\\mathsf{Fml}_{16}(\\Sigma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf i(\\varphi,\\mathsf b).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：§4.1, pp. 221–224 (PDF 241–244)。本页展开其中的多排序一阶片段，使用标签树替代外书公式集；没有声称该文法已包含第五章高阶类型或第十一章依赖谓词的全部句法。通常把标签写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=_su\">\\(t=_su\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\vec t)\">\\(P(\\vec t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot,\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow,\\forall x:s,\\exists x:s\">\\(\\top,\\bot,\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow,\\forall x:s,\\exists x:s\\)</span>。有限阶段并集保证构造存在，树分解唯一保证 FV 递归单值；变量排序由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V_s\">\\(x\\in V_s\\)</span> 唯一决定。量词允许变量遮蔽，FV 的减集定义与之相容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\langle S,F,P,a_F,a_P\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"a_F:F\\to S^*\\times S","display":false},{"tex":"a_P:P\\to S^*","display":false},{"tex":"S^*=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}S^n","display":false},{"tex":"V_s=\\{\\langle s,i\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf v,\\mathsf f,\\mathsf e,\\mathsf p,\\mathsf t,\\mathsf b,\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i,\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{set}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pr}_1,\\operatorname{pr}_2","display":false},{"tex":"a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}","display":false},{"tex":"a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma,A_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Sen}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fml}_{16}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\na_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_1(a_F(f)),\\qquad\na_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pr}_2(a_F(f))\\quad(f\\in F),\\\\\nT_s^0&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathsf v(x)\\mid x\\in V_s\\},\\\\\nT_s^{k+1}&\\coloneqq T_s^k\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf f(f,\\vec t)\\mid f\\in F\\land a_F^{\\mathrm{out}}(f)=s\n\\land\\vec t\\in\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)|}T_{a_F^{\\mathrm{in}}(f)_j}^k\\},\\\\\nT_s&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}T_s^k,\\\\\nA_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\mathsf e(s,t,u)\\mid s\\in S\\land t,u\\in T_s\\}\\cup\n\\{\\mathsf p(p,\\vec t)\\mid p\\in P\n\\land\\vec t\\in\\prod_{j=1}^{|a_P(p)|}T_{a_P(p)_j}\\},\\\\\nL^0&\\coloneqq A_\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\mathsf t,\\mathsf b\\},\\\\\nL^{k+1}&\\coloneqq L^k\\cup\\{c(\\varphi,\\psi)\\mid\nc\\in\\{\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i\\}\\land\\varphi,\\psi\\in L^k\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{q(x,\\varphi)\\mid q\\in\\{\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\\}\\land\nx\\in\\bigcup_{s\\in S}V_s\\land\\varphi\\in L^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}L^k.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf v(x))&\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf f(f,\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{FV}(t_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf e(s,t,u))&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),&\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf p(p,\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j=1}^{|\\vec t|}\\operatorname{FV}(t_j),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf t)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,&\\operatorname{FV}(\\mathsf b)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(c(\\varphi,\\psi))&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi)\n&&c\\in\\{\\mathsf a,\\mathsf o,\\mathsf i\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(q(x,\\varphi))&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n&&q\\in\\{\\mathsf u,\\mathsf x\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ctx}_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in(\\bigcup_{s\\in S}V_s)^*\\mid\n(\\forall i,j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|\\Gamma|\\})(i<j\\Longrightarrow\\Gamma_i\\ne\\Gamma_j)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma\\mid\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\operatorname{set}(\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(()),&\n\\mathsf{Fml}_{16}(\\Sigma)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Form}_\\Sigma,\\\\\n\\neg\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\mathsf i(\\varphi,\\mathsf b).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"t=_su","display":false},{"tex":"P(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\top,\\bot,\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow,\\forall x:s,\\exists x:s","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V_s","display":false}],"bytes":4313,"backlinks":[{"id":"526d014f8a51723a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"仅在 $\\mathrm{FOSig}(\\Sigma)$ 成立的分支，$\\operatorname{Sen}(\\Sigma)$ 采用 [[16-df-formula]] 的形式构造；该页签名分量 $a_F,a_P$ 分别取本页 $\\operatorname{ar}_F,\\operatorname{ar}_P$，$S^{*}$ 使用同一有限列表约定。$\\mathrm{FOSpec}$ 的合法/非法输入分支在 Assertion 显式给出。"},{"id":"7eeed4a02b7c5a5f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)$ 见 [[16-df-formula]]。$J_\\Sigma$ 下文编码一阶序贯；$\\theta$ 是有限公式列表，$\\operatorname{set}(\\theta)$ 为其元素集。"},{"id":"73482b453f46909f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle S,F,P,a_F,a_P\\rangle$ 及所有项/公式树、变量池 $V_s$ 见 [[16-df-formula]]。"},{"id":"3b0e1c2615f805e4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{Fml}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)$ 见 [[16-df-formula]]；$M$ 为该多排序签名的集合模型，$\\operatorname{Asn}_M(\\Gamma)$ 及 $M,\\beta\\models\\varphi$ 采用 [[16-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}